Guard the SVSM probe before reading the SNP secrets page. A normal WHPX guest
can leave Windows data at that physical address across a warm reboot; nonzero
bytes there are not evidence of an AMD SEV-SNP Secure Virtual Services Module.
Without this guard, Windows PE restart reproducibly executes VMGEXIT on Intel
and stalls in OVMF's #UD exception handler. Keep genuine SNP probing unchanged.
